<title>USA: First Data Corp Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>First Data Corp Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>HACKENSACK, N.J. 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.29		    $0.23</p>
<p> Net			136,200		  105,800</p>
<p> Revs		   1,293,800		1,129,700</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 449,000		  447,200</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTE: 1997 results include $50.5 million gain from Genex sale, which was offset by charges of $46.4 million from severance and other activity exit costs.</p>
<p>1996 Q1 includes charges of $16.3 million, or $0.02 a share after tax, from merger costs between First Data and First Financial Management.</p>
<p>Earnings per share and avg shrs reflect November 1996 stock split.</p>
<p>First Call earnings consensus: $0.29 a share.</p>
</text>
